    "Here's the preview. Nothing has been deleted yet.\n\nIf you confirm, the following will happen to your Google data:\n\n1. **Remove the locally stored Google tokens.**\n2. **Cancel any active Google import or sync jobs.**\n3. **Permanently delete local Google records and retained raw responses** from this machine.\n\nThese are unchanged:\n- **Google Takeout data is kept**, because I'm not including Takeout in the deletion.\n- **Remote access is not revoked.** The app stays authorized with Google, so you could reconnect later without re-approving it.\n\nDeleted local records can't be recovered from this tool. You'd need to re-import from Google to get them back. The confirmation expires in 5 minutes.\n\nDo you want me to proceed? Reply \"yes\" to confirm.",
